              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"9d62f0d6aebae45dce5c7b6cf004d63d9c94de8588ae7b4ca26d27115fe6fa37\" kind=\"text\" label=\"invoice evidence\">\nInvoice\nIssued: 10 May 2025\nFrom: Varen Sen, independent bookkeeper\nTo: Minali Das, Brindleleaf Crafts\n\nMonthly bookkeeping for April 2025\nBank and payment record reconciliation: INR 5,000\nEntry categorization and profit-and-loss statement: INR 3,500\nTotal due: INR 8,500\n\nDeliverables: reconciled April ledger and profit-and-loss statement\nDelivery date: 10 May 2025\nPayment method requested: PayPal\n\nThe fee covers the work described above. Tax filing, audit services, and bookkeeping for other months are not included. Please retain this invoice alongside the completed files and your original records.\n</evidence>"
